# <type>[optional scope]: <description>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
# Use the imperative mood, keep the subject under 72 characters, and omit a final period.
# Add a body when the reason or trade-off is not obvious from the diff.
# Add BREAKING CHANGE: <description> in the footer for incompatible changes.
